       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.     SCURHELP.
       AUTHOR.         ANNETTE M. KRAUSS.
       INSTALLATION.   THE GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER COMPANY - AKRON.
       DATE-WRITTEN.   APRIL 6, 1987.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *REMARKS.
      **************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      *D   SCURHELP               CURRENCY CODE HELP SUBPROGRAM    *
      *                                                            *
      **************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      *            THIS PROGRAM READS DCURCODE.PUB.CME             *
      *            FOR THE LOADING OF THE AKRON CONTROLLED         *
      *            CURRENCY CODES INTO THE HELP-SCREEN.            *
      *                                     ANNETTE KRAUSS         *
      *                                                            *
      **************************************************************

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.  I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
              ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZPLTSTUP-SI
              ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
              ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
              FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
              CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
           SELECT DCURCODE-FILE
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFPCSCUCD
              ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC.
           COPY DD-HELP4-O OF ZPLTSTUP.
       01  DISPLAY-REC2.
           COPY DD-HELP5-O OF ZPLTSTUP.
       FD  DCURCODE-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DCURCODE-REC.
           05  DCURCODE-KEY           PIC X(2).
           05  DCURCODE-DESCRIPTION   PIC X(12).
           05  DCUREDI-CODE           PIC XXX.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       77  EOF-SW                        PIC X(1)  VALUE "N".
       01  FILE-STATUS                   PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **                 TERMINAL I/O DATA AREA                  **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************

       01  EDI-HELP-SCREEN.
           05  EHS.
               10  EDI-CURR-CODE-ROW              OCCURS 11 TIMES
                                 INDEXED BY V.
                   15  EDI-CURR-CODE-COLUMN       OCCURS 2 TIMES
                                 INDEXED BY W.
                       20  H-CURR-CODE       PIC XX.
                       20  H-EDI-CODE        PIC XXX.
                       20  H-CURR-CODE-DESC  PIC X(12).
           05  EDI-MESSAGE-LINE1         PIC X(79).
           05  EDI-CMD-LINE              PIC X(79).
           05  EDI-ERR-LINE              PIC X(79).

       01  HELP-SCREEN.
           05  HELP-CURRENCY-INFO             OCCURS 12 TIMES
                             INDEXED BY X.
               10  HELP-DETAIL-CURRENCY-INFO  OCCURS 4 TIMES
                             INDEXED BY Y.
                   15  HELP-CURRENCY-CODE     PIC X(2).
                   15  HELP-CURRENCY-DESC     PIC X(12).
           05  MESSAGE-LINE1             PIC X(79).
           05  MESSAGE-LINE2             PIC X(79).

       COPY DISPDATA   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY IOFEEDBACK IN COPYLIB.
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **               LINKAGE   SECTION                         **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************

       LINKAGE SECTION.

       01  BASE                          PIC X(10).
       COPY VCOMLINK IN COPYLIB.
       COPY LANGSUB  IN COPYLIB.
       01  LS-EDI-INSTAL                 PIC X.

      *************************************************************
      **#########################################################**
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **          P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N           **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      **#########################################################**
      *************************************************************

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BASE,
                                VIEW-COMAREA,
                                LANGUAGE-PARMS
                                LS-EDI-INSTAL.

       0-SCURHELP-SEC SECTION 1.

       0-BEGIN-HERE.
           PERFORM 1-HSK.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-X.
           PERFORM 2-EOJ.

       1-HSK.
           OPEN INPUT DCURCODE-FILE.
           MOVE "N" TO EOF-SW.
           OPEN I-O   DISPLAY-FILE.

       2-EOJ.
           CLOSE DCURCODE-FILE, DISPLAY-FILE.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               DISPLAY "FILE-STATUS".
           GOBACK.

       6-MAIN.
           IF LS-EDI-INSTAL = "Y"
               MOVE "HELP5" TO VIEW-NFNAME
           ELSE
           MOVE "HELP4" TO VIEW-NFNAME.

       6-PUT-BUFFER.
           MOVE SPACES TO HELP-SCREEN EHS EDI-MESSAGE-LINE1.
           PERFORM 621-READ-DCURCODE-FILE THRU 621-RDF-EXIT.
           IF LS-EDI-INSTAL = "Y"
               SET V TO 1
               SET W TO 1
               PERFORM 621-LOAD-WITH-EDI-CODE THRU 621-LWEC-EXIT
               MOVE EDI-HELP-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC2
           ELSE
           SET Y TO 1
           SET X TO 1
           PERFORM 621-LOAD-HELP-SCREEN   THRU 621-LHS-EXIT
           MOVE HELP-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC.

       6-SHOW-FORM.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 0
               IF EOF-SW = "N"
                   GO TO 6-PUT-BUFFER.
       6-MAIN-X.
            EXIT.

       621-LOAD-WITH-EDI-CODE.
           MOVE DCURCODE-KEY         TO H-CURR-CODE (V, W).
           MOVE DCURCODE-DESCRIPTION TO H-CURR-CODE-DESC (V, W).
           MOVE DCUREDI-CODE         TO H-EDI-CODE (V, W).

           IF V = 11 AND W = 2
               IF EOF-SW = "N"
                   MOVE "PRESS ENTER FOR MORE CODES"
                       TO EDI-MESSAGE-LINE1
                   MOVE "f3-EXIT" TO EDI-CMD-LINE
                   GO TO 621-LWEC-EXIT
               ELSE
               MOVE SPACES TO EDI-MESSAGE-LINE1
               MOVE "f3-EXIT" TO EDI-CMD-LINE
               GO TO 621-LWEC-EXIT.

           PERFORM 621-READ-DCURCODE-FILE THRU 621-RDF-EXIT.

           IF EOF-SW = "N"
               IF W = 2
                   SET V UP BY 1
                   SET W TO 1
                   GO TO 621-LOAD-WITH-EDI-CODE
               ELSE
               SET W UP BY 1
               GO TO 621-LOAD-WITH-EDI-CODE.

       621-LWEC-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       621-LOAD-HELP-SCREEN.
           MOVE DCURCODE-KEY         TO HELP-CURRENCY-CODE (X, Y)
           MOVE DCURCODE-DESCRIPTION TO HELP-CURRENCY-DESC (X, Y).
           IF X = 12 AND Y = 4 GO TO 621-LHS-EXIT.
           PERFORM 621-READ-DCURCODE-FILE THRU 621-RDF-EXIT.

           IF EOF-SW = "N"
              IF Y = 4
                  SET X UP BY 1
                  SET Y TO 1
                  GO TO 621-LOAD-HELP-SCREEN
              ELSE
                  SET Y UP BY 1
                  GO TO 621-LOAD-HELP-SCREEN.

       621-LHS-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       621-READ-DCURCODE-FILE.
           READ DCURCODE-FILE AT END
              MOVE "Y" TO EOF-SW.

           IF DCURCODE-KEY = "**"
               GO TO 621-READ-DCURCODE-FILE.

       621-RDF-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       COPY DISPCALL IN COPYLIB.
